      "index": "a1",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "From the age check to the first learners in a class. Each row is a stage, left to right; arrows follow the buttons. Screens on the right of a row, under \"Other states\", are errors and variations that end or loop back.",
      "seed": 1881001807,
      "text": "From the age check to the first learners in a class. Each row is a stage, left to right; arrows follow the buttons. Screens on the right of a row, under \"Other states\", are errors and variations that\nend or loop back.",
